  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I think this request is similar with below.\n\n- A way to share or download pictures taken by players. by Giftea\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/a-way-to-share-or-download-pictures-taken-by-players\n\n- Share your photos with another friend. by Lhun\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/share-your-photos-with-another-friend\n\n- Check photos taken on the spot by Sayo-san\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/check-photos-taken-on-the-spot\n\n-REQUEST-\nI would like to show the pictures of the funny moment to everyone on the spot.\nWith QvPen and Paint Tool, only the people who joined before start drawing are able to see the finished product. That's sad.\nSometimes I want to look back at the hints and explanations written at the entrance.\nIf I can see THEM within VRChat, even if it's just the last 10 or so pictures, and show them to everyone there, my VR experience will be even more wonderful.\n\n決定的瞬間を撮影した写真を、その場でみんなに見せたいです。QvPenやPaint Toolで描かれた絵や作品は、描き始める前にjoinした人にしか、その完成形を見ることはできません。悲しいことです。入り口に書かれたヒントや説明を見返したい時もあります。\n直近10枚程度でもいいので、VRChat内でそれを見ることができて、またその場でみんなに見せることができたら、VR体験はより素晴らしいものになると思います。",
